# Platform: mobilesite
# Requirement: GJDT-22788 — restricted category handling on B2B search ("Current Handlings on Live" table, Prashant 05-Oct-2026)
# Case SR04 Vadodara: Hard category city-wise (RASV) — Gujarat glue-type categories show "No Result Found"
# City: Vadodara (Gujarat). Go-live 22-09-2026 per the table.
# Tags: b2b, search, restricted, GJDT-22788, sanity
# rat glue pad in Vadodara -> no results
store "Vadodara" as city
store "rat glue pad" as search_term
call SG_22788_Freetext_Search_In_City
wait until url contains "/jdmart/${city}"
verify element b2b_search_no_results is visible
verify element b2b_search_no_results contains "No results found" ignoring case
verify element prp_first_product_title is not visible
take screenshot as vadodara_ratgluepad
